   "text": "First, the people when I talk with donors and partners, they are always surprised when they find out how small our team actually is. We are spread all over the globe, literally eight people across seven time zones, and we are doing a lot. And somehow people are always like, wait, that's the whole team? One time a supporter reached out to say it would be more transparent if we listed our whole team on our website. And we had to get back to them saying, really, that is our whole team.",
